}(x)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{2}=x,{f}_{1}=-1,$ and ${f}_{0}=0.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D(\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & =(x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x})\\frac{1}{x} \\\\  & =x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(\\frac{1}{x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}})-(-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =x\\cdot (\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}})+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363038 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363039 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363038 #edb/ref 1069 "q-130248" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363038 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363038 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $D={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+3x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x},$ what is $D(y)$ for $y=\\frac{1}{x}?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363038 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "5a136203-dd8c-5077-8693-b3c3a213b678" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363038 #edb/ref 1074 "The given operator is a third-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{3}(x)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+{f}_{2}(x)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x)y.\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{3}={x}^{2},{f}_{2}=3x,{f}_{1}=-1,$ and ${f}_{0}=0.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D(\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+3x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x})(\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}(\\frac{1}{x})+3x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(\\frac{1}{x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}})+3x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}})-(-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}})+3x(\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}})+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{6}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{6}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363039 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363040 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363039 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363041 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363039 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363042 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363039 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363043 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363039 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363044 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363039 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363039 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363039 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186363040 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363039 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "438741cb-1bf1-5078-92c8-7fcd9f079cc6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363040 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363040 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363040 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7ae9dacd-9221-5bef-a3e2-054140ce493a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363041 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{4}{x}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363041 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363041 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9d49b809-9260-5d2e-bf3c-edbf1cfbe326" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363042 #edb/ref 1080 "2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363042 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363042 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "311f4edb-1ed9-5bdd-a81b-ea812b499a92" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186363043 #edb/ref 1080